Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php-cli, php-soap, php-spojenet-abraflexi, php-spojenet-subreg, php-vitexsoftware-ease-core
Description: Add Subreg domain credit for paid AbraFlexi invoices
 Reads a paid AbraFlexi issued invoice with the KREDIT_DOMENA item and adds
 the ordered credit to the customer's Subreg account. The "API" label of the
 invoice is removed only after the credit was added.

